Are you trying to construct the TS object? Shouldn't it just be this?

TS <- reactive({
  TermStructure(rates = RatesData(), method = "ns")
})

And then wherever you were going to use TS, use TS() ins

curve <- reactive({
Rates(trade.date = input$tradedt)
})

Then you can call curve() to get the value, but only within a renderXXX or a reactive() or an observeEvent(), or similar reactive constructs.

